<concept id="t00860">
	<title>Checking the coolant level</title>
	<shortdesc/>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02736">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02737">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25_B12_003_1_A.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Check the conditions and connections of all cooling system hoses and heater hoses. Replace any swollen or deteriorated hoses.</p>
		<p>When the message 'Refill coolant' displayed on cluster, stop driving and have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>